WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.070
Welcome to TrainerMate This short guide takes you

00:00:04.082 --> 00:00:06.157
from installing the app to checking your first

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:09.134
courses We will also show you how to

00:00:09.147 --> 00:00:11.299
pay for Pro and where to find help

00:00:12.188 --> 00:00:14.250
Pause the video whenever you need to and

00:00:14.263 --> 00:00:16.003
follow along at your own pace

00:00:18.014 --> 00:00:20.295
Start on the TrainerMate website and open the

00:00:20.308 --> 00:00:25.786
Download page Choose Install TrainerMate Windows will take

00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:29.626
you through the official Microsoft Store installation If

00:00:29.639 --> 00:00:32.449
you prefer use Open Microsoft Store to view

00:00:32.461 --> 00:00:36.263
the full listing Once installation has finished open

00:00:36.276 --> 00:00:40.129
TrainerMate from your Windows Start menu Installing the

00:00:40.142 --> 00:00:41.018
app is free

00:00:43.014 --> 00:00:45.888
On the login screen choose Create free account

00:00:46.778 --> 00:00:49.278
Enter your email address and choose a password

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.894
with at least twelve characters an uppercase letter

00:00:52.114 --> 00:00:54.613
a lowercase letter and a number or symbol

00:00:55.503 --> 00:00:58.235
Click Create free account then check your email

00:00:58.248 --> 00:01:01.997
and click the confirmation link Leave TrainerMate open

00:01:02.242 --> 00:01:07.023
it will finish automatically Already registered Log in

00:01:07.036 --> 00:01:09.742
with your existing TrainerMate email and password

00:01:11.758 --> 00:01:15.561
TrainerMate guides you through setup in order First

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:19.388
click Connect Zoom Your web browser opens Zoom’s

00:01:19.401 --> 00:01:22.713
own secure approval page Sign in to the

00:01:22.726 --> 00:01:25.110
Zoom account you use to deliver courses check

00:01:25.123 --> 00:01:27.043
that you have the right account and choose

00:01:27.056 --> 00:01:30.381
Allow or Approve You never enter your Zoom

00:01:30.394 --> 00:01:33.950
password into TrainerMate Return to the app and

00:01:33.963 --> 00:01:36.141
wait for the account to appear as connected

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:40.560
Your saved Zoom account should now say Already

00:01:40.573 --> 00:01:43.512
connected If you use more than one Zoom

00:01:43.525 --> 00:01:45.832
account for training connect each of them here

00:01:45.845 --> 00:01:49.595
before continuing Then choose All connected add a

00:01:49.608 --> 00:01:53.242
provider Later you will choose which Zoom account

00:01:53.255 --> 00:01:55.445
belongs to each provider so it is worth

00:01:55.458 --> 00:01:56.657
getting this right now

00:01:58.662 --> 00:02:01.381
Choose the organisation that supplies your courses from

00:02:01.394 --> 00:02:04.527
the Provider list Select the Zoom account you

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:07.865
want TrainerMate to use for that provider Then

00:02:07.877 --> 00:02:10.158
enter the same username and password you normally

00:02:10.171 --> 00:02:13.986
use on that provider’s FOBS website These are

00:02:13.999 --> 00:02:18.328
your provider details not your TrainerMate password Click

00:02:18.341 --> 00:02:20.352
Add and test provider and wait for the

00:02:20.365 --> 00:02:23.664
login check to finish Add any other providers

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:25.055
you use in the same way

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:31.144
When setup is complete the Dashboard opens On

00:02:31.157 --> 00:02:35.590
Free choose Run full three-week check TrainerMate reads

00:02:35.602 --> 00:02:39.121
your upcoming courses checks existing Zoom details and

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:43.102
prepares supported joining details where needed Wait for

00:02:43.115 --> 00:02:45.074
the check to finish and read the result

00:02:45.963 --> 00:02:48.605
Other scans lets you choose a particular provider

00:02:49.494 --> 00:02:51.659
Pro can check up to twelve weeks ahead

00:02:52.548 --> 00:02:54.984
Show FOBS window is optional if you want

00:02:54.997 --> 00:02:56.234
to watch a manual check

00:02:58.238 --> 00:03:00.493
Open Show all upcoming courses to see the

00:03:00.506 --> 00:03:03.935
full list Read the status and notes beside

00:03:03.948 --> 00:03:07.286
each course Ready means the saved checks look

00:03:07.299 --> 00:03:09.361
in order Please check tells you where to

00:03:09.374 --> 00:03:12.595
look next If a course offers Check course

00:03:12.608 --> 00:03:16.203
only that button checks the selected course If

00:03:16.216 --> 00:03:18.536
TrainerMate asks you to choose an existing Zoom

00:03:18.549 --> 00:03:21.435
meeting confirm it really belongs to that course

00:03:22.325 --> 00:03:25.469
Always make your final course and joining-details check

00:03:25.482 --> 00:03:26.332
before delivery

00:03:28.326 --> 00:03:31.240
You can get started on Free When you

00:03:31.253 --> 00:03:35.505
want Pro open Upgrade The five-pound one-month pass

00:03:35.518 --> 00:03:39.036
is one payment with no renewal The five-pound

00:03:39.049 --> 00:03:43.057
monthly plan renews each month The forty-pound annual

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:46.639
plan renews every twelve months Choose the option

00:03:46.652 --> 00:03:49.333
you want then complete payment on Stripe’s secure

00:03:49.346 --> 00:03:54.023
checkout Return to TrainerMate If Pro has not

00:03:54.036 --> 00:03:56.317
appeared yet allow a few moments and choose

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:59.346
Check plan now Do not pay again just

00:03:59.358 --> 00:04:01.343
because activation is taking a moment

00:04:03.358 --> 00:04:08.076
With Pro active open Automatic updates Tick Automatically

00:04:08.089 --> 00:04:10.228
keep my courses up to date then save

00:04:10.241 --> 00:04:13.475
the settings Change schedule lets you choose a

00:04:13.488 --> 00:04:15.898
small daily check and a wider weekly check

00:04:16.117 --> 00:04:20.357
plus notifications These checks run while TrainerMate is

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.625
open and the computer is awake and connected

00:04:23.514 --> 00:04:25.860
Start with Windows helps keep the app ready

00:04:26.749 --> 00:04:30.357
This page controls course checks Microsoft Store handles

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.890
updates to the app itself

00:04:33.902 --> 00:04:37.808
Pro also includes Calendar Use the month week

00:04:37.898 --> 00:04:40.128
or list view to see your saved courses

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:42.009
or choose This week for a quick look

00:04:42.022 --> 00:04:45.038
at the week ahead Please check focuses on

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.697
courses needing attention Select a course to see

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:52.512
its details and available tools The calendar shows

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:54.960
what TrainerMate has saved so run a course

00:04:54.973 --> 00:04:57.357
check when you need fresh provider information

00:04:59.358 --> 00:05:02.232
If something needs attention open Connections to manage

00:05:02.245 --> 00:05:05.996
Zoom or your providers Check and Repair TrainerMate

00:05:06.009 --> 00:05:08.561
can check saved connection state and refresh Zoom

00:05:08.573 --> 00:05:12.697
access For support open Help enter a subject

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:16.254
and a short message then choose Send Read

00:05:16.267 --> 00:05:19.553
replies in the same Message centre Include the

00:05:19.566 --> 00:05:22.362
provider and course date but never send passwords

00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:26.512
or card details The downloadable PDF covers these

00:05:26.524 --> 00:05:27.865
steps in more detail

00:05:29.878 --> 00:05:33.874
That is the essentials Your account Zoom connection

00:05:33.965 --> 00:05:36.490
and provider setup stay saved so you do

00:05:36.503 --> 00:05:39.699
not need to repeat setup every day Keep

00:05:39.712 --> 00:05:42.612
the PDF guide handy and replay any chapter

00:05:42.624 --> 00:05:45.807
when you need a reminder Certificates are coming

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:49.274
soon in this released version Happy training

